<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <title>Security Bond for Grant of Succession Certificate</title>
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      line-height: 1.6;
      margin: 40px;
      color: #333;
      font-size: large;
    }
    h2 {
      text-align: center;
      text-decoration: underline;
      margin-bottom: 40px;
    }
    p {
      text-align: justify;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }
    ol {
      margin-left: 20px;
    }
    ul {
      margin-left: 20px;
    }
    strong {
      display: inline-block;
      margin-top: 20px;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <h2>Security Bond for Grant of Succession Certificate<br>(Section 375, Indian Succession Act, 1925)</h2>

  <p>
    Know All Men that we, <%= principalName %>, s/o <%= principalFatherName %> r/o <%= principalAddress %> and Mr. <%= suretyName %>, s/o <%= suretyFatherName %> r/o <%= suretyAddress %> (Surety for Mr. <%= principalName %>) bind ourselves jointly and severally to Shri <%= judgeName %>, Distt. Judge, <%= judgeDistrict %> for payment to him or his successor in office of the sum of Rs. <%= bondAmount %>.
  </p>

  <p>
    We have signed this bond on this <%= bondDateDay %> day of <%= bondDateMonth %>, <%= bondDateYear %> at <%= bondPlace %>.
  </p>

  <p>
    Signature: <%= adminSignature %><br>
    Administration
  </p>
  <p>
    Signature: <%= suretySignature %><br>
    Surety
  </p>

  <p>
    WHEREAS, the Court of the said District Judge, Mr. <%= judgeName %>, has passed the order on the day of <%= orderDate %> and has granted the succession certificates in favour of the said Mr. <%= principalName %> to the estate of Late <%= deceasedName %> deceased on the condition that said Mr. <%= principalName %> execute a bond with one surety of Rs. <%= successionAmount %>.
  </p>

  <p>
    AND WHEREAS, the said Mr. <%= principalName %> has agreed to execute the bond for the said Rs. <%= successionAmount %> and the said Mr. <%= suretyName %> has agreed to enter into the above bond as surety for said Mr. <%= principalName %>.
  </p>

  <p><strong>NOW, This Bond Witnesses As Under:</strong></p>
  <ol>
    <li>That the said Mr. <%= principalName %> shall prepare an inventory of the property of the deceased within six months from the date of the execution of the bond.</li>
    <li>That the accounts of the debtor and creditor shall also be prepared by the said Mr. <%= principalName %>.</li>
    <li>That the said Mr. <%= principalName %> shall indemnify the person who may be entitled to the whole or any part of such debts.</li>
    <li>That if the above condition is satisfied then the bond shall remain in force, otherwise the bond shall be void.</li>
  </ol>

  <p>
    We the above mentioned parties have signed this bond on this <%= bondDateDay %> day of <%= bondDateMonth %>, <%= bondDateYear %> after fully understanding the contents of this bond in the presence of the following witnesses.
  </p>

  <p><strong>WITNESSES:</strong></p>
  <ol>
    <li>
      Name: <%= witness1Name %><br>
      Address: <%= witness1Address %><br>
      Signature: <%= witness1Signature %> (Successor)
    </li>
    <li>
      Name: <%= witness2Name %><br>
      Address: <%= witness2Address %><br>
      Signature: <%= witness2Signature %> (Surety)
    </li>
  </ol>

</body>
</html>